    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">MIRA approved on 21 September 2022 the Green Tax Regulation effective 1 January 2023 to increase revenue by (i) widening coverage by including integrated tourist resorts, resort hotels, hotels, and other similar tourist establishment under the green tax; and (ii) increasing rate levied on guesthouses with more than 50 registered rooms and guesthouses in uninhabited islands from $3 per day to $6 per day per guest.</narrative>
    </title>
