   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Parliament on 28 November 2022 passed the Waste Management Bill, which imposes a levy of $0.13 tax on a plastic bag, to boost revenue and to phase out single-use plastics to reduce environment pollution.</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Parliament passed on 16 November 2022 amendments to GST Act effective 1 January 2023 to enhance revenue mobilization by increasing rates for tourism GST and general GST, and MIRA approved GST regulation on 27 November 2022 to implement the amended GST Act.</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Parliament passed on 5 July 2021 amendments to the Airport Taxes and Fees Act with an increase in AF and introduction of a departure tax, and (ii) MIRA approved on 29 September 2021 Airport Taxes and Fees Regulation to implement the amended Act effective 1 January 2022.</narrative>
    </title>
